{"id": "dwayne-jones-connector", "title": "One consultant, four City money streams: the documented roles of Dwayne Jones", "seconds": 130.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "tempo": 1.009, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "9cbabbc429ed549b", "words": 400, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "From 2004 to 2010, Rudolph Dwayne Jones worked in the Mayor’s Office,", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.37, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Rudolph Dwayne Jones", "sub": "Mayor’s Office, 2004 to 2010"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.33, 0.68, 0.93, 1.01, 1.29, 2.01, 2.37, 2.66, 2.97, 3.2, 3.28, 3.37, 3.67]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "in the end as deputy chief of staff.", "t0": 4.37, "t1": 6.2, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Rudolph Dwayne Jones", "sub": "Mayor’s Office, 2004 to 2010"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.34, 0.6, 0.75, 1.11, 1.32, 1.4]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "timeline[1]"], "text": "In 2011, he formed a consulting firm, RDJ Enterprises.", "t0": 6.32, "t1": 9.71, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Mayor’s Office", "sub": "2004 to 2010"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "RDJ Enterprises", "sub": "formed 2011"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Urban Ed Academy", "sub": "founded 2012"}], "kicker": "Rudolph Dwayne Jones"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.37, 0.79, 0.91, 1.15, 1.22, 1.71, 2.2, 2.67]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[3]", "oneLine"], "text": "From mid-2016 through 2024, how much City-related money reached his entities?", "t0": 9.83, "t1": 16.14, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "July 2016 to December 2024", "sub": "every City-related payment to his entities"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.66, 1.24, 1.47, 1.72, 2.75, 2.96, 3.21, 3.86, 4.14, 4.41, 4.55]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[3]", "amount"], "text": "15.2 million dollars.", "t0": 16.14, "t1": 17.89, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$15.2 million", "label": "from 11 City bodies"}, "emph": ["15.2"], "wt": [0.04, 0.49, 0.75, 0.95, 1.25]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[3]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "That count comes from the Controller and City Attorney, in March 2025.", "t0": 18.41, "t1": 22.28, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "Controller and City Attorney, March 11, 2025", "text": "Jones-related entities received $15.2 million from 11 City bodies. The Controller did not find it improper.", "mark": "did not find it improper"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.55, 0.77, 0.92, 1.03, 1.49, 1.6, 1.88, 2.52, 2.69, 2.95, 3.21]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[3]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "They did not call that money improper.", "t0": 22.4, "t1": 23.97, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "Controller and City Attorney, March 11, 2025", "text": "Jones-related entities received $15.2 million from 11 City bodies. The Controller did not find it improper.", "mark": "did not find it improper"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.27, 0.44, 0.61, 0.76, 0.97]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Their review finds Jones in four City money streams. Only one led to charges.", "t0": 24.09, "t1": 28.25, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["Four", "roles"], "sub": "one of them charged"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.54, 0.85, 1.17, 1.29, 1.52, 1.75, 1.97, 2.8, 3.13, 3.34, 3.51, 3.6]}, {"scene": "puc", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "First, the water and power agency, the SFPUC.", "t0": 28.47, "t1": 30.7, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "fiber", "label": "Community Benefits program", "kicker": "First: the water agency", "sub": "SFPUC, 2011"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.45, 0.68, 0.78, 1.06, 1.45, 1.58]}, {"scene": "puc", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In 2011, his firm helped it create a Community Benefits program.", "t0": 30.82, "t1": 34.06, "shot": "b6x", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "fiber", "label": "Community Benefits program", "kicker": "First: the water agency", "sub": "SFPUC, 2011"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.43, 0.97, 1.14, 1.37, 1.6, 1.69, 1.94, 2.0, 2.39, 2.77]}, {"scene": "puc", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[1]", "established[10]"], "text": "Firms bidding for its work pledge money to community groups. That earns them points.", "t0": 34.18, "t1": 38.24, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Firms bidding for SFPUC work", "sub": "pledge money to community groups"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Community groups", "sub": "nearly $22 million pledged by 2021"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Jones-related groups", "sub": "$591,397 received"}], "kicker": "Community Benefits, created 2011 with RDJ"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.66, 0.78, 0.92, 1.16, 1.46, 1.67, 1.77, 2.19, 3.03, 3.27, 3.47, 3.62]}, {"scene": "puc", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "suspicious[1].why", "established[3]"], "text": "Later, groups tied to Jones got 591,397 dollars of those pledges.", "t0": 38.36, "t1": 44.17, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Firms bidding for SFPUC work", "sub": "pledge money to community groups"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Community groups", "sub": "nearly $22 million pledged by 2021"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Jones-related groups", "sub": "$591,397 received"}], "kicker": "Community Benefits, created 2011 with RDJ"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 0.8, 0.99, 1.1, 1.39, 1.58, 1.84, 2.16, 2.59, 3.38, 3.75, 4.13, 4.69, 5.04, 5.12, 5.3]}, {"scene": "puc", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[4]", "established[3]"], "text": "As subcontractors, his entities also got", "t0": 44.29, "t1": 46.35, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5,501,242", "label": "SFPUC contract 1000000051, sewer-program management", "sub": "of $9,034,868 as SFPUC subcontractors"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.99, 1.15, 1.65, 1.93]}, {"scene": "puc", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[4]", "established[3]"], "text": "5,501,242 dollars for sewer-program management alone.", "t0": 46.35, "t1": 49.57, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5,501,242", "label": "SFPUC contract 1000000051, sewer-program management", "sub": "of $9,034,868 as SFPUC subcontractors"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.26, 0.54, 0.79, 1.06, 1.35, 1.71, 1.86, 2.44, 2.82]}, {"scene": "rates", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Second, in 2017, Jones was the paid advocate for households in Recology’s rate case.", "t0": 49.79, "t1": 54.76, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Ratepayer advocate", "kicker": "Second: the garbage rates", "sub": "Recology rate case, 2017"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.51, 0.63, 0.88, 1.87, 2.18, 2.32, 2.42, 2.7, 3.14, 3.27, 3.71, 3.83, 4.37, 4.56]}, {"scene": "rates", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "defense[2]"], "text": "No document says what Jones did there, or accuses him of anything.", "t0": 54.88, "t1": 57.86, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["What Jones did as ratepayer advocate"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.66, 0.82, 0.95, 1.23, 1.4, 1.81, 1.98, 2.32, 2.44, 2.54]}, {"scene": "grant", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[5]"], "text": "Third, the charge.", "t0": 58.08, "t1": 59.93, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Charged, August 2023", "kicker": "Third: the grants", "sub": "bribing grant director Lanita Henriquez"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.72, 0.87]}, {"scene": "grant", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[5]"], "text": "In August 2023, prosecutors charged Jones with bribing grant director Lanita Henriquez.", "t0": 59.93, "t1": 65.19, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Charged, August 2023", "kicker": "Third: the grants", "sub": "bribing grant director Lanita Henriquez"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.26, 0.58, 0.83, 1.72, 2.37, 2.72, 3.04, 3.2, 3.58, 3.84, 4.23, 4.57]}, {"scene": "grant", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "They say she gave his firms 23 contracts, over 1.4 million dollars,", "t0": 65.31, "t1": 69.79, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Lanita Henriquez", "sub": "23 contracts, over $1.4 million"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Jones’s entities", "sub": "July 2016 to July 2020"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Checks back", "sub": "$32,942 to her, $156,821 to her circle"}], "kicker": "Alleged"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.3, 0.45, 0.65, 0.8, 1.22, 1.76, 2.48, 2.75, 2.94, 3.21, 3.48, 3.79]}, {"scene": "grant", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "while they wrote checks to her circle.", "t0": 69.79, "t1": 71.46, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Lanita Henriquez", "sub": "23 contracts, over $1.4 million"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Jones’s entities", "sub": "July 2016 to July 2020"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Checks back", "sub": "$32,942 to her, $156,821 to her circle"}], "kicker": "Alleged"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.26, 0.42, 0.66, 0.97, 1.1, 1.24]}, {"scene": "grant", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "notEstablished[0]", "established[6]", "established[16]"], "text": "A charge is an allegation, not a conviction. He pleaded not guilty.", "t0": 71.58, "t1": 75.54, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "An allegation, not a conviction", "sub": "District Attorney's files, 2011 to 2026: 24 of 38 resolved corruption cases ended in conviction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.51, 0.64, 0.74, 1.68, 1.87, 1.92, 2.93, 3.08, 3.37, 3.54]}, {"scene": "grant", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "notEstablished[0]", "established[6]"], "text": "The City suspended him in September 2023.", "t0": 75.66, "t1": 78.21, "shot": "b16x", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A charge is an allegation, not a conviction."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.38, 0.84, 0.97, 1.06, 1.58, 1.88]}, {"scene": "art", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[7]", "story[4]"], "text": "Fourth, Urban Ed Academy, which got about 2.9 million dollars in City grants.", "t0": 78.43, "t1": 83.15, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Urban Ed Academy", "kicker": "Fourth: the nonprofit", "sub": "founded by Jones, 2012", "chip": "$2,941,983 in City grants"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.62, 0.97, 1.12, 1.91, 2.13, 2.3, 2.52, 2.73, 2.97, 3.19, 3.48, 3.84, 3.94, 4.19]}, {"scene": "art", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "timeline[10]"], "text": "In December 2023, it gave Human Rights Commission director Sheryl Davis a portrait. What did it cost?", "t0": 83.27, "t1": 89.84, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "December 2023", "kicker": "A portrait", "sub": "of Human Rights Commission director Sheryl Davis"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.51, 0.75, 1.68, 1.82, 2.02, 2.28, 2.49, 2.88, 3.27, 3.57, 4.02, 4.11, 5.26, 5.43, 5.56, 5.62]}, {"scene": "art", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[8]"], "text": "5,500 dollars.", "t0": 89.84, "t1": 91.64, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5,500", "label": "a portrait of Sheryl Davis"}, "emph": ["5,500"], "wt": [0.04, 0.32, 0.82, 1.06, 1.27]}, {"scene": "art", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "suspicious[3].why"], "text": "On January 1, 2024, her department entered a 270,000 dollar grant with it.", "t0": 92.16, "t1": 97.67, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2023-12-01", "to": "2024-01-01", "days": "", "fromLab": "portrait posted", "toLab": "$270,000 grant agreement", "kicker": "A portrait"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.58, 1.15, 1.43, 2.38, 2.5, 2.95, 3.31, 3.39, 3.63, 3.98, 4.31, 4.64, 4.92, 5.18, 5.39]}, {"scene": "art", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "suspicious[3].why"], "text": "The Controller says that creates at least the appearance of a bribe.", "t0": 97.79, "t1": 100.4, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2023-12-01", "to": "2024-01-01", "days": "", "fromLab": "portrait posted", "toLab": "$270,000 grant agreement", "kicker": "A portrait"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.57, 0.78, 0.95, 1.34, 1.43, 1.63, 1.73, 2.09, 2.18, 2.24]}, {"scene": "art", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[9]", "established[8]"], "text": "Supervisor Shamann Walton got a 5,500 dollar portrait too.", "t0": 100.52, "t1": 104.56, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Supervisor Shamann Walton", "a $5,500 portrait"], "b": ["an OEWD grant", "second-lowest score"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.67, 1.01, 1.76, 1.96, 2.03, 2.27, 2.62, 2.85, 3.06, 3.31, 3.71]}, {"scene": "art", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[9]", "established[8]"], "text": "And it won a grant despite the second-lowest score.", "t0": 104.68, "t1": 106.83, "shot": "b21x", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Supervisor Shamann Walton", "a $5,500 portrait"], "b": ["an OEWD grant", "second-lowest score"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.2, 0.35, 0.42, 0.72, 1.05, 1.16, 1.72]}, {"scene": "art", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[3]", "defense[1]"], "text": "Jones had no formal role there by then. Nothing shows he had a part in the portraits.", "t0": 106.95, "t1": 110.85, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "no formal role there in 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.43, 0.57, 0.89, 1.08, 1.26, 1.39, 2.07, 2.42, 2.71, 2.79, 2.9, 2.96, 3.13, 3.21, 3.3]}, {"scene": "airport", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[12]", "story[5]", "established[18]"], "text": "Fifth, not City money: his firm held 10 percent of an Airport shop venture.", "t0": 111.07, "t1": 115.07, "shot": "b31a", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "HG SFO Retailers 2017 JV", "kicker": "Fifth: the Airport", "sub": "RDJ Enterprises, a 10 percent partner; the venture pays the City rent"}, "emph": ["10 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.6, 0.84, 1.22, 1.41, 1.68, 1.87, 2.09, 2.51, 2.61, 2.7, 3.07, 3.34]}, {"scene": "airport", "kind": "span", "ref": ["established[12]", "established[13]", "notEstablished[6]", "timeline[9]", "timeline[12]", "established[17]"], "text": "The Airport had it end ties in 2023. 2024 notices extending its existing leases still name him: an old list?", "t0": 115.19, "t1": 122.17, "shot": "b31b", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2023-09-07", "to": "2024-04-02", "days": "", "fromLab": "City suspends Jones", "toLab": "Board extends existing airport leases (COVID program)", "kicker": "Board file 240049"}, "emph": ["still name him"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.55, 0.7, 0.83, 1.0, 1.35, 1.46, 1.73, 2.89, 3.19, 3.66, 4.08, 4.52, 4.66, 5.07, 5.42, 5.64, 5.81, 6.25, 6.4, 6.59]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[11]", "timeline[14]", "next[3]", "established[14]", "established[15]", "notEstablished[7]"], "text": "In November 2025, a grand jury indictment joined him with Henriquez and Ellicott.", "t0": 122.39, "t1": 126.97, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Indictment CRI-25025111", "sub": "18 November 2025: Ellicott, Henriquez and Jones; no plea to it on the registers"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.59, 0.87, 1.58, 1.7, 2.0, 2.25, 2.73, 3.02, 3.16, 3.32, 3.94, 4.08]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 127.09, "t1": 129.21, "shot": "b25", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.64, 0.79, 1.05, 1.16, 1.25, 1.49, 1.74]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Four roles", "puc": "The water agency · $5.5 million", "rates": "The garbage rates", "grant": "The charge · $1.4 million", "art": "The portraits · $5,500", "airport": "The Airport · 10 percent", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "timeline"}